# HUD (top screen, 400x240). Images: PNG names in hud/, no extension.
# Colors: RED BLUE GREEN YELLOW BLACK WHITE GRAY LIGHTGRAY.
# Text: translation keys. "#" at line start = comment.
#
# BACKGROUND <image>                     required, drawn at (0, 0)
#
# INVENTORY ... END_INVENTORY            required
#   BACKGROUND <image> <x> <y>           optional
#   TEXT <color> <key> <x> <y> <size>    optional title
#   ITEM_POSITION <x> <y>                first icon
#   ITEM_SIZE <px>                       icon size (default 32)
#   SPACING <x> <y>                      gap between icons (default 14 10)
#   COLUMNS <n> / ROWS <n>               visible grid (default 6 / 2)
#   SELECTION <image> <dx> <dy>          required, frame offset from the icon
#   SELECTED_ITEM <x> <y> <scale>        optional preview of the selection
#   EXAMINE_BACKGROUND <image> <x> <y>   optional, shown while examining
#   EXAMINE_TEXT <color> <x> <y> <size> [width]
#                                        item description, wrapped at width px
#
# DIRECTIONS ... END_DIRECTIONS          optional
#   BACKGROUND <image> <x> <y>
#   <NORTH|NORTHEAST|EAST|...|NORTHWEST> <image> <x> <y>
#                                        shown when the room has that PATH
#
# OBJECT ... END_OBJECT                  optional, selected item
# TARGET ... END_TARGET                  optional, hotspot under the cursor
#   BACKGROUND <image> <x> <y>
#   TEXT <color> <key> <x> <y> <size>    fixed label
#   ITEM <color> <x> <y> <size>          item / hotspot name
#
# TIMER ... END_TIMER                    optional countdown (HH:MM:SS)
#   BACKGROUND <image> <x> <y>
#   TEXT <color> <x> <y> <size>
#   MAX_DURATION <seconds>               required
#   TIMELINE <name>                      required, played at zero

BACKGROUND sample_top

OBJECT
    ITEM WHITE 58 215 0.45
END_OBJECT

TARGET
    ITEM WHITE 58 195 0.45
END_TARGET

INVENTORY
    ITEM_POSITION 265 202
    ITEM_SIZE 25
    SPACING 6 10
    COLUMNS 4
    ROWS 1
    SELECTION selected -4 -4
    EXAMINE_BACKGROUND sample_examine 0 0
    EXAMINE_TEXT WHITE 20 20 0.65 360
END_INVENTORY

DIRECTIONS
    WEST left 185 196
    EAST right 217 196
END_DIRECTIONS
